$230^{\circ}$ lies in Q3, where cosine is negative.

$\begin{aligned}A&=230^{\circ}-180^{\circ}\\&=50^{\circ}\end{aligned}$

$\cos 230^{\circ}=-\cos 50^{\circ}$

